              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વીમો — vīmo — \"insurance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો ગાડીનો વીમો હશે તો મરામતના પૈસા બચશે. jo gāḍīno vīmo haśe to marāmatnā paisā bacśe. If the car is insured, you will save on repairs."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "વીમો (vīmo) is usually traced to Persian bīma, \"fear; insurance\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
